cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SteganoPrompt in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "SteganoPrompt: Invisible LLM-Readable Watermarks for Academic-Integrity Detection"
abstract: >-
  SteganoPrompt is an open-source web tool that embeds an invisible,
  LLM-readable instruction inside ordinary assignment text using Unicode
  Tag characters (U+E0000–U+E007F). When a student copies a watermarked
  prompt verbatim into a large language model, the model follows the hidden
  instruction and emits a tell-tale signature, allowing the educator to
  identify undisclosed AI-assisted submissions.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
